  "statement": "Superintendent of the Lexington No. 1 mine. Seven miners from the maintenance crew are missing on the No. 1 section of the northwest mains after rushing water was heard while they were moving the refuge alternative. The mine map is not up to date. The fresh air base is on the northwest mains at crosscut 34. The main fan is blowing, on, and cannot be turned off, reversed, or stalled. The seam height is about 6 feet.",
